	('a674e096-d23b-4183-8f8e-6fcf5768d24f', 'solo', 'food', 'Find the most ordinary breakfast people in {destination} actually eat on a weekday. Photograph your plate and write what surprised you.', NULL, '2026-10-22 00:00:00+00', 'The breakfast nobody photographs', 'Tourist menus show the festive dishes; everyday breakfasts tell you how a city starts work.', '{"typical weekday breakfast {destination}","street breakfast {destination}"}', 'solo_guide', 'Breakfast habits follow work hours, climate and what grows nearby — it is economics on a plate.', 'Under $5 at most stalls', '{foodie,explorer}'),
	('3821cf0d-b0e1-4c12-9e8c-bf2abf20d3c8', 'solo', 'language', 'Learn three polite phrases in the local language and use each one for real today. Write down the reaction each one got.', NULL, '2026-10-22 00:00:00+00', 'Three words that open doors', 'A greeting in someone''s own language changes the tone of almost any exchange.', '{"basic phrases {destination}","polite greetings {destination} language"}', 'solo_guide', 'Politeness words reveal what a culture values most — respect for age, time or hospitality.', 'Free', '{culture,explorer,chill}'),
	('a61f24b2-ffb9-473d-a6ef-f4311a5a15a6', 'solo', 'language', 'Photograph a public sign you can''t read, then work out what it says. Write the translation and why it''s there.', NULL, '2026-10-22 00:00:00+00', 'The sign you couldn''t read', 'Signs are free lessons in grammar, rules and humor.', '{"common signs {destination}","{destination} script basics"}', 'solo_guide', 'Public signs show what a city worries about — from queues to quiet hours.', 'Free', '{explorer,photographer,culture}'),
	('abef9bd2-2969-41ea-be5d-d4aa4ae67b3f', 'solo', 'language', 'Find out what locals call one food, place or object differently from the official name. Photograph it and tell the story behind the nickname.', NULL, '2026-10-22 00:00:00+00', 'Name it like a local', 'Nicknames carry history that guidebooks leave out.', '{"local slang {destination}","nickname {destination} landmark"}', 'solo_guide', 'Nicknames often come from old trades, jokes or events that the official name erased.', 'Free', '{culture,foodie,explorer}'),
	('3a2568da-7d78-4e5c-8773-e8c18509209e', 'solo', 'history', 'Find a building, plaque or street name in {destination} tied to a historical event. Photograph it and write the event in two sentences.', NULL, '2026-10-22 00:00:00+00', 'A wall that remembers', 'Cities keep their memory in stone, paint and street names.', '{"historic plaque {destination}","street names history {destination}"}', 'solo_guide', 'Street names change when history changes — renaming is how a country rewrites its story.', 'Free', '{culture,explorer,photographer}'),
	('d4c3f02d-e21c-4c1f-8b21-35eae495ce59', 'solo', 'money', 'Spend the local equivalent of about one US dollar on the best thing you can find. Photograph it and compare it with home.', NULL, '2026-10-22 00:00:00+00', 'What a dollar buys here', 'Small purchases explain prices, wages and daily life faster than any chart.', '{"cost of living {destination}","cheap local snacks {destination}"}', 'solo_guide', 'Economists use cheap everyday items to compare what money is really worth between countries.', 'About $1', '{shopper,foodie,explorer}'),
	('96ab5d2b-ef5e-4b97-a76f-38116eb446cf', 'solo', 'business', 'Spot a one-person business — a stall, cart or repair stand. Photograph the setup (not the person unless they agree) and figure out how it makes money.', NULL, '2026-10-22 00:00:00+00', 'The tiny business that works', 'Small vendors run on clever, low-cost systems.', '{"street vendors {destination}","informal economy {destination}"}', 'solo_guide', 'Street trade is a huge share of jobs in many economies — tiny margins, fast turnover.', 'Free', '{shopper,explorer,foodie}'),
	('21470b0c-47d2-40eb-94d0-bf41abcc07e0', 'solo', 'materials', 'Find a craft or everyday object made from a local material (wood, clay, fiber, stone). Photograph it and explain why that material.', NULL, '2026-10-22 00:00:00+00', 'Made from what''s around', 'Crafts grow from what the land provides.', '{"traditional crafts {destination}","local materials {destination} craft"}', 'solo_guide', 'Materials follow geography: bamboo in humid places, stone where wood is scarce.', 'Free to look, souvenirs under $15', '{shopper,culture,photographer}'),
	('d0303816-3bad-40b4-8f60-71ef95f7da9b', 'solo', 'music', 'Record 10 seconds of a public sound unique to {destination} (no faces, no conversations) and photograph where you heard it. Describe what it is.', NULL, '2026-10-22 00:00:00+00', 'The sound of the street', 'Every city has a soundtrack — bells, calls, engines, birds.', '{"traditional music {destination}","city sounds {destination}"}', 'solo_guide', 'Sounds are cultural signals: calls to market, temple bells and traffic rules you can hear.', 'Free', '{explorer,chill,photographer}'),
	('92256184-7b8a-4a51-a4dd-498b70180867', 'solo', 'music', 'Find one song by an artist from this country, listen to it somewhere meaningful and photograph that spot. Write what the lyrics or rhythm are about.', NULL, '2026-10-22 00:00:00+00', 'A song from here', 'Music is a shortcut to how people feel about home.', '{"famous musicians {destination}","popular songs {destination}"}', 'solo_guide', 'Popular music often carries regional instruments and rhythms into modern charts.', 'Free', '{chill,culture,night_owl}'),
	('c554019e-d077-42f3-a6c9-0e32d535ba43', 'solo', 'film', 'Find a place in {destination} that appears in, or feels like, a well-known film or show from or about this country. Recreate the shot and say which scene.', NULL, '2026-10-22 00:00:00+00', 'Scene from a film', 'Film shapes how the world imagines a place — sometimes accurately, sometimes not.', '{"films set in {destination}","famous directors {destination}"}', 'solo_guide', 'Film tourism can transform a neighborhood''s economy within a few years.', 'Free', '{photographer,culture,explorer}'),
