	('cba38b5d-cba7-4f0e-810c-9e1e58d83b2d', 'solo', 'etiquette', 'Find one etiquette rule visitors often miss here — shoes, queues, tipping, chopsticks, hands. Show where you saw it and how you followed it.', NULL, '2026-10-22 00:00:00+00', 'The rule nobody told you', 'Knowing the unwritten rules is the fastest way to be welcomed.', '{"etiquette tips {destination}","cultural do and dont {destination}"}', 'solo_guide', 'Etiquette usually protects something practical — hygiene, time or respect for elders.', 'Free', '{culture,explorer,chill}'),
